    LLM: 'Game: Spoons. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Spoons (also known as Tongue or Pig) is a fast-paced shedding and elimination game played with a standard card deck and a set of spoons (one less than the number of players). The objective is to collect four of a kind (e.g., four 6s) and then grab a spoon. As soon as one spoon is taken, everyone else must grab a spoon. The person left without a spoon is eliminated or receives a letter (S-P-O-O-N).',
